{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>On Mount Sinai.</b> There is no earlier and later in the Torah, and this pericope is prior to Leviticus and all the pericopes that come after it, for the speech was at Mount Sinai. And now the covenant written in the pericope of \"And these are the judgments\" was sealed, and it is mentioned in this place to connect the conditions of the land. And just as He said concerning the forbidden sexual relations, \"for on account of them the land will vomit them out,\" so He said in the pericope of \"If in My statutes\" concerning the sabbaths of the land, and He mentioned at the beginning the explanation of the sabbaths."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:13.366957584Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}